Just to clarify a bit. The way for calculating plod I mentioned above:

 overall LOD (chr 5 and 9 QTL and their interaction plus sex) - LOD (sex alone) - (2*main+light)

The part- LOD (sex alone) is derived from the null model which only includes sex.

